       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PHOTONIC-CHIRP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PHOTONIC-CHIRP-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CHIRP-LINEARITY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MODE-HOP-SUPPRESS-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DEMODULATION-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CHIRP-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHOTONIC-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PHOTONIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CHP-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CHP-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CHIRP-AND-MODE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DEMOD-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CHP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CHIRP-AND-MODE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHIRP-LINEARITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MODE-HOP-SUPPRESS-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DEMOD-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DEMODULATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHIRP-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CHP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CHIRP-LINEARITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MODE-HOP-SUPPRESS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DEMODULATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CHIRP-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PHOTONIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CHP-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CHP-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CHP-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CHP-CODE.
